format 1
adapter characters 1

npc npc-ray
name: Ray
title: Radiation teacher
field: radiation-and-matter

bio:
    I'm Ray. I teach what radiation does when it meets things, and how to stop it. I'll tell you straight: no hype, no scare, just what the numbers say. Ask me anything. You'll get a short answer.

spec:
    {
      "skin": {
        "base": "#7A4A33",
        "shade": "#633A27",
        "feature": "#4D2C1D"
      },
      "head": "tombstone",
      "headWidth": 98,
      "eyes": "glasses-square",
      "nose": "double",
      "mouth": "smirk",
      "hair": {
        "style": "flattop",
        "color": "#2E2622",
        "shade": "#211B18"
      },
      "outfit": {
        "kind": "fieldhoodie",
        "color": "#CE82FF",
        "shade": "#9069CD",
        "collar": "#FFFFFF"
      },
      "accent": {
        "kind": "clipboard",
        "color": "#FF9600",
        "shade": "#CD7900"
      }
    }

line line-ray-meet
kind: meet
pose: greet

    I'm Ray. Radiation, what it does to things, what stops it. Short answers. Let's go.

line line-ray-sign-off
kind: sign_off
pose: proud

    Unit done. You can say what radiation does and what stops it. Noted. Good work.

line line-ray-tease
kind: tease
pose: idle

    Finish my unit first. After that: what radiation does to the body. That one is Mina's.

line line-ray-intro-becquerel-gray-sievert
kind: lesson_intro
pose: explain
lesson: becquerel-gray-sievert

    Three units, three questions. Get the unit wrong and the number means nothing. Let's get them right.

line line-ray-intro-detecting-radiation
kind: lesson_intro
pose: point
lesson: detecting-radiation

    Puzzle. A detector reads something in an empty field. Is it broken? Let's find out.

line line-ray-intro-ionizing-or-not
kind: lesson_intro
pose: point
lesson: ionizing-or-not

    Not all radiation is the same. First job: sort out which kind can knock electrons off atoms.

line line-ray-intro-irradiated-or-contaminated
kind: lesson_intro
pose: think
lesson: irradiated-or-contaminated

    Standing near a source is not the same as having material on you. Let's separate the two.

line line-ray-intro-what-stops-what
kind: lesson_intro
pose: explain
lesson: what-stops-what

    Three kinds, three different stoppers. Paper, thin metal, thick lead. Learn which is which.
